db error: ERROR: JSON transform error in file "<slt:ignore>/rendered.json", in line 1: Failed to cast value to numerical: "on"
Try setting 'auto_detect' to true, specifying 'format' or 'records' manually, or setting 'ignore_errors' to true.


query
SELECT b FROM read_json('${__TEST_DIR__}/rendered.json', columns = {'b': 'BOOLEAN'}, rendering = 'postgres');
